#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:3 5a5430e18deb431c92f8cd65baea8904
msgid "Passwordless root access implementation"
msgstr "無密碼 root 存取實作"

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:6 1703fd302f2b4cc08013666356d41da5
msgid ""
"The rationale behind passwordless root in qubes is set out :doc:`here </user/"
"security-in-qubes/vm-sudo>`. Implementation is by the qubes-core-agent-"
"passwordless-root package."
msgstr ""
"\"\"Qubes 中無密碼 root 的設計原理說明請參閱 :doc:\\`此處 </user/security-in-"
"qubes/vm-sudo>\\`。實作由 qubes-core-agent-passwordless-root 套件提供。"

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:8 1e5c1771574d4e3983ae89f13b67d922
msgid ""
"This page sets out the configuration changes made, with (not necessary "
"complete) list of mechanisms depending on each of them:"
msgstr ""
"此頁面列出了所做的配置變更，以及依賴於各項配置的機制列表（可能不完整）："

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:10 cda1f60ae768413c995d6c3c96f23766
msgid "sudo (``/etc/sudoers.d/qubes``):"
msgstr "sudo（``/etc/sudoers.d/qubes``）："

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:21 63478851c6c64e1f9e0ee740d6bef2e1
msgid "Easy user -> root access (main option for the user)."
msgstr "輕鬆的使用者 -> root 存取（使用者的主要選項）。"

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:23 1cbf6b4a40ec490f951a941d53d5a8fd
msgid "``qvm-usb`` (not really working, as of R2)."
msgstr "``qvm-usb``（截至 R2 版本實際上無法正常運作）。"

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:27 61a828bcade543658b49ea424221aca7
msgid "PolicyKit (``/etc/polkit-1/rules.d/00-qubes-allow-all.rules``):"
msgstr "PolicyKit（``/etc/polkit-1/rules.d/00-qubes-allow-all.rules``）："

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:35 64f81560638e43a18434106659dc6d46
msgid ""
"PAM (``/etc/pam.d/su.qubes`` or ``/usr/share/pam-configs/su.qubes``) "
"``auth        sufficient  pam_succeed_if.so use_uid user ingroup qubes``"
