"PAM（``/etc/pam.d/su.qubes`` 或 ``/usr/share/pam-configs/su.qubes``）"
"``auth        sufficient  pam_succeed_if.so use_uid user ingroup qubes``"

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:37 a9de14a4ad084933aa8465c8a2c14043
msgid "NetworkManager configuration from normal user (``nm-applet``)."
msgstr "普通使用者進行 NetworkManager 配置（``nm-applet``）。"

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:39 11714122be2944748580b22a9289aede
msgid "Updates installation (``gpk-update-viewer``)."
msgstr "更新安裝（``gpk-update-viewer``）。"

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:41 c379299576c946648ffdc533a0fcdd38
msgid ""
"User can use pkexec just like sudo **Note:** above is needed mostly because "
"Qubes user GUI session isn’t treated by PolicyKit/logind as “local” session "
"because of the way in which X server and session is started. Perhaps we will "
"address this issue in the future, but this is really low priority. Patches "
"welcomed anyway."
msgstr ""
"使用者可以像使用 sudo 一樣使用 pkexec **注意：** 上述設定之所以必要，主要是因"
"為Qubes 使用者的 GUI 工作階段不被 PolicyKit/logind 視為「本地」工作階段，這是"
"由於 X 伺服器和工作階段的啟動方式所致。也許我們未來會解決這個問題，但這確實優"
"先順序很低。無論如何都歡迎提供修補程式。"

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:45 e804deafcafd4b609a36870d8cd5beb2
msgid "Empty root password:"
msgstr "空的 root 密碼："

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:47 3d06f1148bd64eb685288a45b9464212
msgid ""
"Used for access to ‘root’ account from text console (``qvm-console-dispvm``) "
"- the only way to access the VM when GUI isn’t working."
msgstr ""
"用於從文字主控台（``qvm-console-dispvm``）存取 'root' 帳號— 當 GUI 無法運作時"
"存取 VM 的唯一方式。"

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:49 1661f55682cd421d9b5859d36003b98e
msgid "Can be used for easy ‘su -’ from user to root."
msgstr "可用於輕鬆地從使用者 'su -' 到 root。"
